{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27110007","formula":"OP","hill":"OP","elements":["O","P"],"composition":{"O":1.0,"P":1.0},"names":{"en":"Phosphoryl","ru":"Монооксид фосфора"},"descriptions":{"en":"Phosphorus monoxide is an unstable radical inorganic compound with molecular formula PO. Phosphorus monoxide is notable as one of the few molecular compounds containing phosphorus that has been detected outside of Earth. Other phosphorus containing molecules found in space include PN, PC, PC2, HCP and PH3. It was detected in the circumstellar shell of VY Canis Majoris and in the star forming region catalogued as AFGL 5142.","ru":"Монооксид фосфора — молекула-радикал с химической формулой PO. Монооксид фосфора известен как одно из немногих молекулярных соединений, содержащих фосфор, которое было обнаружено за пределами Земли. Другие фосфорсодержащие молекулы, обнаруженные в космосе, включают PN, PC, PC2, HCP и PH3. Он был обнаружен в околозвездной оболочке VY Большого Пса и в области звездообразования, занесенной в каталог как AFGL 5142."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":6857426,"mass":46.973,"charge":0,"smiles":"O=[P]","inchikey":"LFGREXWGYUGZLY-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"6857426","atoms":2,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.756,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.756,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"P"}],"bonds":[[0,1,2.0]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27110007","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phosphorus_monoxide","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BE%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%8